'''''Poet, Speak of the Sky Through Me (II)''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Fall at Dawn's Rise]].

==Steps==
# Use the celestial globe to alter the firmament and reveal the past.
# Speak with Hyacine and prepare to face the final truth

